v0.33.0 (2026-10-12)
====================

Feat
----

-  add raw_data mode to skip value serialization (#315)
-  set the Python 3.10 floor and remove the Python 2 support layer
   (#278)

Fix
---

-  remove the per-call struct format strings from the response parse
   path (#286)
-  show the password state in Protocol.\__str\_\_
-  keep distributed hash ring placement
-  replace assert guards, add an exception message, and stop a password
   leak
-  Minor performance improvements in hot paths (#263)

